    {
      "id": "kv_ablation_txt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2216.5,
      "y": 1388.5,
      "width": 742.0,
      "height": 88.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2b8a3e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0074",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 954619524,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1675813683,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "离线消融实测：为什么命中率从 40.48% 跃升至 78.96%\n(simulate_kv_cache_ablation · 2 只读子代理 + 16 步主循环同轨迹对比)\n• Legacy (工具过滤 + 状态前置 + 逐轮滑窗删1组)  ➔  Optimized (全量共享 + 瞬态置尾 + 0.62 阶梯水位)\n• 累计块命中率：40.48% ➔ 78.96% (+38.48 pp) ｜ 末步稳态命中率：34.85% ➔ 88.14% (+53.29 pp)\n• 窗口滑动重排：8 次 ➔ 2 次 (-75.0%) ｜ 重算 Prefill 字符减少 66.82% ｜ 等效输入成本节省 57.27%",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "kv_ablation",
      "originalText": "离线消融实测：为什么命中率从 40.48% 跃升至 78.96%\n(simulate_kv_cache_ablation · 2 只读子代理 + 16 步主循环同轨迹对比)\n• Legacy (工具过滤 + 状态前置 + 逐轮滑窗删1组)  ➔  Optimized (全量共享 + 瞬态置尾 + 0.62 阶梯水位)\n• 累计块命中率：40.48% ➔ 78.96% (+38.48 pp) ｜ 末步稳态命中率：34.85% ➔ 88.14% (+53.29 pp)\n• 窗口滑动重排：8 次 ➔ 2 次 (-75.0%) ｜ 重算 Prefill 字符减少 66.82% ｜ 等效输入成本节省 57.27%",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
